  "name": "Fire — Daily Ritual",
  "short_name": "Fire",
  "description": "A free offline habit tracker and daily ritual checklist. It resets each morning, tracks 100%-day streaks, and stores every task and tick in localStorage on your device — no account, no server, no tracking.",
